{
  "name": "Ops digest · Weekly summary",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6ab9d680-e485-4f91-a487-84a6c16fd33e",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## Ops digest · Weekly summary\nEvery Monday, gathers the week's numbers from sales, orders, support and the site, compares them with the week before, and sends one readable summary.\n\n**Needs:** ANALYTICS_API_KEY, ANALYTICS_BASE_URL, CHAT_API_KEY, CHAT_BASE_URL, DB_API_KEY, DB_BASE_URL, EMAIL_API_KEY, EMAIL_BASE_URL, LLM_API_KEY, LLM_BASE_URL, LLM_MODEL\n**Source and tests:** github.com/kimjoshuadr/n8n-workflows · `systems/ops-digest`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2cbae22-9d4c-4f91-af96-2bae0e3600f4",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "name": "Monday 08:30",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "30 8 * * 1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
